  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, during the Varginha case, in which a craft is said to have crashed in the Brazilian town of Varginha and a living creature to have been captured, a US Air Force plane is said to have landed at Campinas while helicopters collected something from Varginha. Jose Fernandez, who tells Michels he witnessed the Varginha events, says only that \"the US Air Force made a landing in Campinas,\" and he brings in Luis Elizondo, a former Pentagon official who worked on UFO reports, and the film Moment of Contact. If true, it would mean the United States took part in recovering whatever was found."
